# Firebase Console requirements:
# - Authentication > Sign-in method > Email/Password must be enabled.
# - Google sign-in is optional; this app primarily uses email/password.
# - Authentication > Settings > Authorized domains must include localhost for local dev
#   and sohn0356-git.github.io for GitHub Pages.
# - Realtime Database must be enabled and use firebase/database.rules.json.
# - Storage must be enabled and use firebase/storage.rules.
